build/
dist/
# Generated once by packaging/build_exe.py, and big.
sample/
*.o
*.so
*.dll
*.dylib
*.exe
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.aoews

# Run-time output. The log records absolute paths, the machine's platform
# string and the Python build, none of which belong in a shared repository.
*.log
# Generated test data. .aoe is the extension the application filters on, so
# every file holding data to test with uses it.
*.aoe
# The binary sidecar written beside a result file. Derived data: rebuilt from
# the .aoe in seconds, tied to one exact copy of it, and megabytes apiece.
*.aoec
*.aoec.*.tmp
# The layout of an HDF5 file, written down so that opening it again costs no
# tree walk. Derived data, rebuilt in seconds, and tied to one exact copy of
# the file it describes.
*.aoelay
*.aoelay.tmp
data/
_archive_/

# LaTeX build products. The guide's PDF is committed; the intermediate files
# pdflatex needs for its second pass are not, and they change on every build.
doc/*.aux
doc/*.out
doc/*.toc
# Scoped to doc/ on purpose: *.out is also one of the extensions real result
# files use, and the application filters on it.
